<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0337_R07R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You heard about the accident at\nthe Power Plant? Out east, near\fLavender.\rThe lights in my house been\nflickerin’. Or that’s ghosts.\fLavender’s close.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0337_R07R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I take my guard job SERIOUS. Ayo!\nYou got a Pokédex.\fAight. You can go through.\fThat’s my whole job. Lookin’ at\nPokédexes.</language>
	</row>
</body>
